{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_207_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，春，王正月，葬宋元公。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"二、三月，公至自齊，居於鄆。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"公次於陽州，其曰至自齊何也？以齊侯之見公，可以言至自齊也。居於鄆者，公在外也。至自齊，道義不外公也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"三、夏，公圍成。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"非國不言圍。所以言圍者，以大公也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會齊侯、莒子、邾子、杞伯、盟於鄟陵。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"五、公至自會，居於鄆。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"六、九月，庚申，楚子居卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"七、冬，十月，天王入於成周。尹氏、召伯、毛伯以王子朝奔楚。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_207_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_207","textTraditional":"周有入無出也。遠矣，非也。奔，直奔也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}